  <Schema xmlns="EverQuestData" xmlns:dt="EverQuestDataTypes" />
  <!-- ============================================================
       Modernized buff window, "quiet grid" (Slate Glass HUD frame, background at half opacity)
       - empty slots draw nothing, so a faded buff leaves blank space instead of an empty box
       - buffs fill from the top left, down each column (slots 1-7 in the first column), so
         active buffs gather on the left and the free space collects on the right
       - each buff is a slate card: icon well on the left, name, and a dark tab in the
         bottom-right corner behind the game's timer; gold edge on hover
       - the cards are drawn above the names (see-through interiors), so the whole card
         highlights and takes clicks, including over the name
       Layout: 6 columns x 7 rows = all 42 slots in 868 x 175. 6px between columns, 2px between rows.
       Names are placed per slot to match the cards, so keep the window at this size.
       ============================================================ -->
